  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Org for Soc. Sci. Research in Eastern and SouthernAfrica (OSSREA) - OSSREA 2004-10</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Org for Soc. Sci. Research in Eastern and SouthernAfrica (OSSREA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organization for Social Science Research in Eaastern and Southern Africa (OSSREA) &#xE4;r ett regionalt n&#xE4;tverk f&#xF6;r forskare inom samh&#xE4;llsvetenskap. OSSREAs verksamhet syftar till att stimulera samh&#xE4;llsvetenskaplig forskning och att bidra till metodutveckling inom forskarutbildning vid nationella universitet.Sida gav MSEK 31 under avtalsperioden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Organization for Social Science Research in Eastern and Southern Africa (OSSREA) is a regional network for researchers in social sciences. OSSREA&apos;s activities aims at stimulating social science research, and contribute to improving knowledge in research  methodology at the post graduate level in State owned Universities. The total contribution was MSEK 31 during the agreement period.</narrative>
  </description>
